#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:1
msgid "E4220"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `regex_match_binding_not_supported`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:5
msgid "A lexical case uses a binding that is not available in its matching mode."
msgstr "词法分支使用了当前匹配模式不支持的绑定。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:7
msgid ""
"For `String` and `StringView` inputs, first-match `lexmatch` supports "
"both `before=` and `after=`. Longest-match mode starts at the beginning "
"of the input, so it supports `after=` but not `before=`. `lexscan` does "
"not support either binding: streaming targets consume their input "
"buffers, while an in-memory `@lexbuf.StringScanner` stores the next scan "
"position in its `cursor` field."
msgstr ""
"对于 `String` 和 `StringView` 输入，首次匹配的 `lexmatch` 同时支持 `before=` 和 "
"`after=`。最长匹配模式从输入开头开始，因此支持 `after=`，但不支持 `before=`。`lexscan` "
"不支持这两种绑定：流式目标会消费输入缓冲区，而内存中的 `@lexbuf.StringScanner` 会在其 `cursor` "
"字段中存储下一次扫描的位置。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:13
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn first_word(input : String) -> StringView {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\" as word, before=_) => word\n"
"    _ => \"\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:19
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:21
msgid ""
"For `lexscan`, remove `before=` or `after=` and anchor the regex at `^`. "
"For `lexmatch`, remove `before=`, anchor the regex at `^`, and use "
"`after=` when the unmatched suffix is needed."
msgstr ""
"对于 `lexscan`，请移除 `before=` 或 `after=`，并用 `^` 锚定正则开头。对于 `lexmatch`，请移除 "
"`before=`，用 `^` 锚定正则开头；需要未匹配的后缀时使用 `after=`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:25
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn first_word(input : String) -> StringView {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\" as word, after=_) => word\n"
"    _ => \"\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
